an><em>駭人</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type3-blank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type3-blank0\" data-check-id=\"type3-blank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:type3-blank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"自行填寫\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n</div><div class=\"fs-type\">\n<div class=\"fs-type-head\"><label for=\"ac-type4-pick\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"ac-type4-pick\" data-check-id=\"type4-pick\"> <strong>坐騎</strong></label> <span class=\"fs-muted\">（馬、騾， <input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:type4-other\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"…\" autocomplete=\"off\">)</span></div>\n<p class=\"stat-line\">HP 12；護甲 0；傷害 d6+1（<em>近身</em>, <em>近戰</em>)</p>\n<p class=\"fs-muted\">再選4項：</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-picks\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-0\" data-check-id=\"type4-0\"> <span>+4 HP</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-1\" data-check-id=\"type4-1\"> <span>+1 護甲（厚皮）</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-2\" data-check-id=\"type4-2\"> <span>傷害改為 +2 傷害、 <em>強力</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-3\" data-check-id=\"type4-3\"> <span><em>好鬥</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-4\" data-check-id=\"type4-4\"> <span><em>靈巧</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-5\" data-check-id=\"type4-5\"> <span><em>神駿</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-6\" data-check-id=\"type4-6\"> <span><em>沉穩</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-7\" data-check-id=\"type4-7\"> <span><em>機靈</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-8\" data-check-id=\"type4-8\"> <span><em>吃苦耐勞</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-9\" data-check-id=\"type4-9\"> <span><em>鼻子靈</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled aria-label=\"起始已勾選\"> <span><em>巨大</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-11\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-11\" data-check-id=\"type4-11\"> <span><em>力大</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-12\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-12\" data-check-id=\"type4-12\"> <span><em>飛快</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-blank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-blank0\" data-check-id=\"type4-blank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:type4-blank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"自行填寫\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"instinct\">本能</h3>\n<p>選1。</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst0\" data-check-id=\"inst0\"> <span>恃強嚇弱</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst1\" data-check-id=\"inst1\"> <span>調皮搗蛋</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst2\" data-check-id=\"inst2\"> <span>填飽肚子</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst3\" data-check-id=\"inst3\"> <span>受驚炸毛</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst4\" data-check-id=\"inst4\"> <span>分心走神</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst5\" data-check-id=\"inst5\"> <span>撒歡亂竄</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst6\" data-check-id=\"inst6\"> <span>撒腿便追</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"instblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"instblank0\" data-check-id=\"instblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:instblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"自行填寫\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"cost\">代價</h3>\n<div class=\"fs-row\"><p>選1。</p><div class=\"arcana-track fs-loyalty\" data-check-list=\"ac-loyalty\"><span class=\"track-label\">忠誠</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"ac-loyalty-0\" title=\"忠誠 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"ac-loyalty-0\" data-check-id=\"ac-loyalty-0\" aria-label=\"忠誠 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"ac-loyalty-1\" title=\"忠誠 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"ac-loyalty-1\" data-check-id=\"ac-loyalty-1\" aria-label=\"忠誠 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"ac-loyalty-2\" title=\"忠誠 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"ac-loyalty-2\" data-check-id=\"ac-loyalty-2\" aria-label=\"忠誠 3\"></label></span></div></div>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost0\" data-check-id=\"cost0\"> <span>玩耍、梳毛、訓練與愛撫</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost1\" data-check-id=\"cost1\"> <span>獨處的時光，任它遊蕩</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost2\" data-check-id=\"cost2\"> <span>舒適的窩、安逸與充足的食物</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"costblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"costblank0\" data-check-id=\"costblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:costblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"自行填寫\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"beast-of-legend\">傳說之獸</h3>\n<p>每次選取傳說之獸時，選1：</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"legend0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"legend0\" data-check-id=\"legend0\"> <span>它 <em>卓異</em> （見下方「號令追隨者」）</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"legend1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"legend1\" data-check-id=\"legend1\"> <span>它獲得 +4 HP 與 +1 護甲</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"legend2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"legend2\" data-check-id=\"legend2\"> <span>它生出一種獨一無二的能力或特質</span></label></li></ul>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><span class=\"fs-label\">備註</span><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:notes\" rows=\"3\" aria-label=\"備註\"></textarea></div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"order-followers\">號令追隨者</h3>\n<p>當你 <strong><em>指使它做出某個行動、而它照做</em></strong>時，若其任一標籤適用，擲 +1 而非 +屬性（若它還是 <em>卓異</em>的，則擲 +2）。若無標籤適用，擲 +0。若其任一標籤會礙事，擲骰帶劣勢。</p>\n<p>當它 <strong><em>沒有得到指令</em></strong> 或 <strong><em>自作主張行事</em></strong>時，由GM決定它做什麼、結果如何。</p>\n<h3 id=\"strengthen-your-bond\">加深羈絆</h3>\n<p>當你 <strong><em>付出它的代價</em></strong> 且近來未曾付出過時，它持有 +1 忠誠（上限3）。</p>\n<p>按1比1花費其忠誠，可讓它：</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>克服恐懼，照你說的做</li><li>剋制住不按其本能/標籤/特質行事</li><li>去做它不願做的事（只要不是傷天害理或自尋死路）</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"loyal-to-the-end\">不離不棄</h3>\n<p>當 <strong><em>你的夥伴降至 0 HP</em></strong>時，擲 +0，若它持有忠誠則帶優勢： <strong>10+時</strong>，只要恢復任意HP它就沒事； <strong>7-9時</strong>，它獲得 <em>受傷</em> 標籤； <strong>6-時</strong>，它受了傷，若無人相救，不久便會死去。</p>"
}
